  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media 4 EU- Civil Society Program for the participation of media in North Macedonia&apos;s EU membership negotiations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Overall objective: To upgrade media capacities to cover, follow and scrutinize the EU membership negotiation process of North Macedonia.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Specific objectives:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1.To improve the environment for media participation in EU membership negotiation process;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2.To empower and strengthen media professional capacities of non-EU journalists on EU regulations, policies and values and to enhance opportunities for young journalists.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3.To create an environment for networking activities with European counterparts and colleagues from the media sector, to support and enhance the media literacy and diversity of the media landscape.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
